","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#管理建议","content":"建立配置变更审批和记录"},"2757":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-54","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#管理建议","content":"页面展示异常"},"2758":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-55","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#管理建议","content":"先排查站点配置、字体资源和浏览器缓存"},"2759":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-56","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#交付前检查","content":"登录页截图是否符合项目形象。"},"2760":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-57","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#交付前检查","content":"工作台名称和 Logo 是否正确。"},"2761":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-58","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#交付前检查","content":"仪表盘和大屏是否使用统一字体。"},"2762":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-59","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#交付前检查","content":"分享页面是否有正确品牌信息。"},"2763":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-60","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#交付前检查","content":"导出文件是否能正确显示字体。"},"2764":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-61","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#交付前检查","content":"交付验收建议保留截图：登录页、工作台、一个仪表盘预览、一个大屏预览、一个导出文件。这样后续客户或业务方反馈品牌展示问题时，可以快速对比变更前后效果。"},"2765":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-