635":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-12","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#排查基本顺序","content":"这个顺序适合大多数问题。先确认现象和影响范围，是为了避免把单个用户的权限问题误判成系统故障；先记录时间，是为了在审计日志和应用日志中快速定位；最后用普通账号验证，是为了避免管理员账号验证通过但业务用户仍然不可用。"},"4636":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-13","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#提交问题时建议提供","content":"信息"},"4637":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-14","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#提交问题时建议提供","content":"示例"},"4638":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-15","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#提交问题时建议提供","content":"环境"},"4639":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-16","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#提交问题时建议提供","content":"单机、离线、Kubernetes、外部 MySQL"},"4640":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-17","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#提交问题时建议提供","content":"版本"},"4641":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-18","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#提交问题时建议提供","content":"Crest 版本号、部署时间"},"4642":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-19","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#提交问题时建议提供","content":"用户"},"4643":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-20","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#提交问题时建议提供","content":"发生问题的账号和角色"},"4644":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-21","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#提交问题时建议提供","content":"页面"},"4645":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-22","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#提交问题时建议提供","content":"具体菜单、资源名称、访问地址"},"4646":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-23","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#提交问题时建议提供","content":"时间"},"4647":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-24","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#提交问题时建议提供","content":"问题发生时间，精确到分钟更好"},"4648":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-25","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tag