k","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#升级前检查","content":"版本说明"},"5393":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-21","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#升级前检查","content":"阅读目标版本的变更、兼容性和已知问题"},"5394":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-22","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#升级前检查","content":"当前版本"},"5395":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-23","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#升级前检查","content":"记录当前 Crest 版本、镜像版本和安装包来源"},"5396":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-24","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#升级前检查","content":"数据库备份"},"5397":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-25","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#升级前检查","content":"完成升级前完整备份"},"5398":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-26","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#升级前检查","content":"配置备份"},"5399":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-27","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#升级前检查","content":"保存 Compose、环境变量、Secret、证书、Ingress"},"5400":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-28","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#升级前检查","content":"加密配置"},"5401":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-29","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/main