/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#冻结生产变更","content":"升级前暂停资源编辑、批量导出、数据集缓存任务和配置变更。"},"5411":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-39","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#备份生产环境","content":"备份数据库、配置、运行目录、证书、密钥和当前镜像版本。"},"5412":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-40","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#执行升级","content":"替换安装包或镜像，按部署方式执行升级命令。"},"5413":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-41","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#观察启动日志","content":"重点关注数据库迁移、连接池、后台任务和错误日志。"},"5414":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-42","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#完成功能验证","content":"按上线检查清单验证登录、权限、数据源、数据集、仪表盘、大屏、分享和导出。"},"5415":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-43","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#开放用户访问","content":"验证通过后通知用户恢复使用，并保留升级观察窗口。"},"5416":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-44","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#开放用户访问","content":"升级过程中不要同时做无关配置变更。例如不要一边升级版本，一边改域名、SSO、数据库密码、加密模式或权限模型。多个变更叠加会让问题定位变得困难。"},"5417":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-45","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#开放用户访问","content":"从旧版本升级到 v1.5.10 时，如果不需要国密能力，继续保持 `CREST_CRYPTO_MODE=standard` 即可；用户操作流程不需要调整。如果项目需要启用 `sm-suite`，应先在测试环境验证密钥、登录、数据源、数据集、仪表盘、大屏、分享、导出和 SSO，再安排生产维护窗口。"},"5418":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-roll