/upgrade-rollback#开放用户访问","content":"升级当天建议准备一张操作记录表，按时间记录命令、输出、截图和结论。出现问题时，这张表比事后回忆更可靠。"},"5435":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-63","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#升级后验证清单","content":"模块"},"5436":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-64","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#升级后验证清单","content":"验证内容"},"5437":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-65","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#升级后验证清单","content":"登录"},"5438":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-66","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#升级后验证清单","content":"本地账号、SSO 账号、密码修改"},"5439":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-67","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#升级后验证清单","content":"权限"},"5440":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-68","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#升级后验证清单","content":"普通用户菜单、资源可见范围"},"5441":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-69","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#升级后验证清单","content":"数据源"},"5442":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-70","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#升级后验证清单","content":"连接测试、表结构读取"},"5443":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-71","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#升级后验证清单","content