"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-165","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#绑定目标图表","content":"选中查询组件，在右侧配置要影响哪些图表。一个筛选器可以影响一个或多个图表。"},"5955":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-166","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#选择筛选字段","content":"给每个目标图表选择对应字段。不同数据集之间字段名称可能不同，要确认业务含义一致。"},"5956":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-167","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#设置展示方式","content":"日期字段使用日期或日期范围；区域、部门、产品使用下拉或搜索；金额、时长使用数字区间。"},"5957":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-168","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#设置默认值","content":"常见默认值包括本月、最近 30 天、全部区域、当前用户所属组织。"},"5958":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-169","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#预览验证","content":"保存后进入预览，切换筛选条件，确认所有目标图表同步变化。"},"5959":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-170","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#预览验证","content":"查询组件配置要点："},"5960":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-171","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#预览验证","content":"配置项"},"5961":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-172","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#预览验证","content":"说明"},"5962":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-173","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#预览验证","content":"常见问题"},"5963":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-174","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#预览验证","content":"目标