包含范围。例如“销售额”不如“本月销售额”清楚；“完成率”不如“本月需求完成率”清楚。"},"6046":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-257","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第二步添加指标卡","content":"可按以下步骤操作："},"6047":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-258","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#添加第一张指标卡","content":"从图表面板选择指标卡，放到页面第一行左侧。选择经营数据集，把“销售额”或自己的核心指标拖到指标位置。"},"6048":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-259","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#设置标题和单位","content":"标题写成“本月销售额”或“本月交付需求数”。金额统一万元或元，数量统一整数。"},"6049":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-260","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#复制组件","content":"复制三份指标卡，横向排列，保持相同高度和间距。"},"6050":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-261","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#替换字段","content":"分别把指标换成订单数、客单价、毛利率，或替换成需求数、完成率、平均周期、风险数。"},"6051":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-262","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#预览核对","content":"保存并预览，确认筛选条件改变后四张指标卡都同步变化。"},"6052":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-263","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第三步添加趋势图","content":"趋势图回答“最近是否变好”。示例配置如下："},"6053":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-264","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第三步添加趋势图","content":"配置项"},"6054":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-265","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第三步添加趋势图","content":"示例字段（可替换）"},"6055":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-266","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-gui