日期是否连续，指标单位是否一致。如果销售额和订单数差异很大，建议拆成两张图，或者使用双轴图并明确左右轴单位。"},"6066":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-277","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第三步添加趋势图","content":"趋势图建议保留横轴日期和悬浮提示。标签过密时不宜全部显示，否则页面可读性会下降。业务汇报中，趋势图标题要写清统计周期，例如“近 30 天销售额趋势”。"},"6067":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-278","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第三步添加趋势图","content":"配置趋势图时，日期字段是常见出错点。日期如果被识别成文本，就会按字符串排序，`2026-10` 可能排在 `2026-2` 前面。遇到这种情况，回到数据集把字段类型改成日期，或者在 SQL 中转换日期。"},"6068":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-279","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第四步添加排行图和明细表","content":"排行图用于定位贡献最高或风险最高的对象；明细表用于进一步追溯。"},"6069":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-280","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第四步添加排行图和明细表","content":"图表"},"6070":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-281","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第四步添加排行图和明细表","content":"示例字段（可替换）"},"6071":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-282","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第四步添加排行图和明细表","content":"配置重点"},"6072":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-283","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第四步添加排行图和明细表","content":"区域销售排行"},"6073":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-284","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第四步添加排行图和明细表","content":"区域 + 销售额"},"6074":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-285","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第四步添加排行图和明细表","content":"销售额降序，限制 Top 10"},"6075":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-286","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第四步添加排行图和明细表","content":"门店销售排行"},"6076":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-287","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第四步添加排行图和明细表","content":"门店 + 销售额"},"6077":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-288","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第四步添加排行图和明细表","content":"门店名称长时用条形图"},"6078":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-289","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第四步添加排行图和明细表","content":"渠道结构"},"6079":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-290","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第四步添加排行图和明细表","content":"渠道 + 销售额"},"6080":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-291","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第四步添加排行图和明细表","content":"分类不超过 6 个"},"6081":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-292","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第四步添加排行图和明细表","content":"门店明细表"},"6082":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-293","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第四步添加排行图和明细表","content":"门店、区域、销售额、订单数、毛利率"},"6083":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-294","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第四步添加排行图和明细表","content":"列宽、排序、导出权限"},"6084":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-295","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第四步添加排行图和明细表","content":"表格不宜放置过多列。正式页面中，表格的价值是追溯问题，而不是把数据库整张表搬进仪表盘。"},"6085":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-296","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第四步添加排行图和明细表","content":"明细表放在页面底部更合适。用户先看指标和趋势，发现异常后再下拉查看明细。表格如果允许导出，发布前要确认列权限和导出权限。"},"6086":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-297","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第四步添加排行图和明细表","content":"表格建议只保留能帮助定位问题的列。例如经营页面保留区域、门店、负责人、销售额、订单数、毛利率；项目页面保留项目、需求编号、阶段、负责人、在库天数、优先级。不应把数据库中的所有字段都放进表格。"},"6087":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-298","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第五步添加查询组件","content":"顶部查询组件建议先做日期和业务范围："},"6088":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-299","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#添加日期筛选","content":"放在页面顶部，默认值可以设置为本月或最近 30 天。"},"6089":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-300","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#添加区域筛选","content":"使用下拉或搜索组件，绑定区域字段。"},"6090":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-301","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#绑定目标图表-1","content":"日期筛选通常绑定全部图表；区域筛选绑定趋势图、排行图和明细表。"},"6091":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-302","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#预览验证-1","content":"保存后进入预览，切换日期和区域，确认所有目标图表都同步变化。"},"6092":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-303","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#预览验证-1","content":"如果多个图表来自不同数据集，字段名称可以不同，但业务含义必须一致。例如一个数据集叫“区域”，另一个叫“销售大区”，只要口径一致就可以映射。"},"6093":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-304","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#预览验证-1","content":"查询组件验收可按固定步骤执行：保存后进入预览，先记录一个指标卡数值，再切换筛选条件。如果目标图表没有变化，回到编辑器检查目标组件、筛选字段和默认值。"},"6094":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-305","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#预览验证-1","content":"这张图可对照“添加筛选器”的入口。日期、下拉、文本搜索、数字区间都属于查询组件。添加后必须绑定目标图表和字段；如果只把组件放到页面上，用户点击它不会影响任何图表。"},"6095":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-306","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#预览验证-1","content":"示例：日期筛选绑定所有图表的“日期”字段，区域筛选绑定所有图表的“区域”字段。若某张图来自另一个数据集，也要为它单独映射字段。"},"6096":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-307","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#样式配置","content":"样式配置用于改善阅读体验，不用于修改业务口径。"},"6097":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-308","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#样式配置","content":"常用配置："},"6098":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-309","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#样式配置","content":"配置"},"6099":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-310","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#样式配置","content":"建议"},"6100":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-311","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#样式配置","content":"标题"},"6101":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-312","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#样式配置","content":"标题写业务含义，不写字段名"},"6102":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-313","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#样式配置","content":"单位"},"6103":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-314","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#样式配置","content":"金额统一元、万元或亿元，不混用"},"6104":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-315","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#样式配置","content":"小数位"},"6105":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-316","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#样式配置","content":"百分比、金额、数量分别统一"},"6106":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-317","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#样式配置","content":"颜色"},"6107":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-318","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#样式配置","content":"同类指标保持一致，异常值使用固定警示色"},"6108":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-319","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#样式配置","content":"图例"},"6109":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-320","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#样式配置","content":"系列多时打开图例，系列少时可以关闭"},"6110":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-321","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#样式配置","content":"标签"},"6111":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-322","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#样式配置","content":"数值过密时不宜全部显示"},"6112":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-323","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#样式配置","content":"坐标轴"},"6113":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-324","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#样式配置","content":"趋势图需要清晰时间轴，排名图需要清晰分类轴"},"6114":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-325","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#样式配置","content":"空值"},"6115":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-326","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#样式配置","content":"明确显示为空、0 或不显示"},"6116":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-327","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#样式配置","content":"正式页面不要过度使用颜色。一个页面中通常只需要一组主色、一组辅助色和少量警示色。"},"6117":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-328","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#配置联动","content":"联动用于从一个图表筛选其他图表。例如点击“华东区域”，页面中的趋势图、产品排行和明细表都切换到华东数据。"},"6118":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-329","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#配置联动","content":"配置步骤："},"6119":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-330","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#配置联动","content":"保存仪表盘。"},"6120":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-331","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#配置联动","content":"选中作为触发源的图表。"},"6121":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-332","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#配置联动","content":"在右侧高级配置中打开联动设置。"},"6122":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-333","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#配置联动","content":"选择被影响的目标图表。"},"6123":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-334","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#配置联动","content":"设置源字段和目标字段。"},"612