/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#缓存更新和定时任务","content":"缓存状态"},"6498":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-288","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#缓存更新和定时任务","content":"展示最近执行状态、缓存可用状态、源数据行数、缓存行数和一致性校验结果"},"6499":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-289","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#缓存更新和定时任务","content":"发布页面前必须确认缓存可用且校验结果符合预期"},"6500":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-290","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#全量更新","content":"全量更新会重新拉取数据集范围内的数据。它适合数据量不大、字段结构经常变化，或没有可靠增量字段的数据集。"},"6501":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-291","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#全量更新","content":"操作步骤："},"6502":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-292","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#打开数据集编辑器","content":"进入“数据准备 → 数据集”，选择目标数据集并进入编辑。"},"6503":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-293","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#切换为缓存读取","content":"在左侧配置区把“读取方式”选为“缓存”。如果页面没有该选项，说明当前数据集或数据源不支持缓存。"},"6504":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-294","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#选择全量","content":"在“更新方式”中选择“全量”。全量方式不需要增量字段。"},"6505":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-295","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#设置更新频率","content":"需要人工控制时选“手动”；需要固定刷新时选“定时”，再设置分钟、小时或天级间隔。"},"6506":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-296","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#立即更新并验收","content":"点击“立即更新”，等待状态变为可用。然后切到数据预览，抽查行数、日期范围和核心指标。"},"6507":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-297","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#立即更新并验收","content":"全量更新配置简单，但数据量越大，执行时间和源库压力越高。正式环境建议避开业务高峰，例如设置在凌晨或数据仓库批处理完成之后。"},"6508":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-298","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#立即更新并验收","content":"点击“立即更新”时，系统会先保存当前数据集和缓存配置，再提交同步任务。修改字段、过滤条件、更新方式或定时配置后，不需要先单独保存一次再更新，但仍应在任务结束后检查预览结果。"},"6509":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-299","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"增量更新只拉取水位字段之后的新数据，并定期做全量校准。它适合订单、日志、需求流转、工单、流水等持续增长的数据。"},"6510":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-300","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"高级设置用于控制缓存任务的稳定性。增量字段决定同步起点；全量刷新间隔用于定期校准缓存；超时时间防止任务长期挂起；更新后校验用于发现源端和缓存端差异。"},"6511":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-301","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"高级设置不应随意跳过。增量字段选错时，常见问题不是任务失败，而是产生隐性漏数。比如需求状态会回写历史记录，只用创建时间做增量，就可能漏掉历史需求的状态变化；这种场景更适合用更新时间作为水位字段。"},"6512":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-302","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"切换增量字段或更新方式时，系统会清理旧水位。下一次同步会按新配置重新计算水位，不会继续沿用旧字段的同步位置。变更前建议记录原字段、变更原因和首次同步结果，方便回溯。"},"6513":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-303","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"增量更新要先选对水位字段。常见选择如下："},"6514":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-304","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"字段类型"},"6515":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-305","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"是否推荐"},"6516":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-306","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"说明"},"6517":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-307","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"自增主键"},"6518":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-308","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"推荐"},"6519":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-309","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"数据持续新增且不会回写历史记录时适合"},"6520":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-310","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"更新时间"},"6521":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-311","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"推荐"},"6522":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-312","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"适合会补录、修正状态或更新历史记录的数据"},"6523":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-313","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"创建时间"},"6524":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-314","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"谨慎"},"6525":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-315","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"只能覆盖新增数据，覆盖不了历史记录修改"},"6526":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-316","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"业务日期"},"6527":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-317","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"谨慎"},"6528":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-318","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"如果会补历史日期，容易漏数"},"6529":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-319","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"文本编号"},"6530":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-320","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"不推荐"},"6531":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-321","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"排序和比较规则不稳定"},"6532":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-322","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"增量配置步骤："},"6533":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-323","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#选择增量","content":"在“更新方式”中选择“增量”。系统会尝试识别可用的增量字段。"},"6534":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-324","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#确认增量字段","content":"展开“更多设置”，选择自增 ID、更新时间或其他可靠水位字段。不要仅因为字段排在第一个就直接使用。"},"6535":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-325","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#设置全量刷新间隔","content":"增量任务建议保留周期性全量校准，例如每 24 小时做一次全量刷新，用来修正遗漏、补录和水位异常。"},"6536":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-326","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#设置超时时间","con