ocs/crest/user-guide/datasource-78","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#支持的数据源类型","content":"保存后像表一样创建数据集"},"6699":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-79","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#支持的数据源类型","content":"接口文档、请求地址、Token"},"6700":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-80","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#支持的数据源类型","content":"API"},"6701":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-81","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#支持的数据源类型","content":"先把接口结果配置成 API 表，再创建数据集"},"6702":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-82","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#支持的数据源类型","content":"只有截图或人工统计结果"},"6703":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-83","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#支持的数据源类型","content":"先整理成 Excel/CSV"},"6704":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-84","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#支持的数据源类型","content":"不建议直接进入系统，先把字段和数据行整理清楚"},"6705":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-85","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#支持的数据源类型","content":"示例说明：如果要做“项目交付看板”，项目、需求、工时这些数据来自研发系统数据库，就选数据库；季度目标来自人工维护的表格，就选 Excel/CSV；供应商 SLA 来自外部服务接口，就选 API。它们可以分别创建数据源，再在数据集里组合使用。"},"6706":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-86","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-mysql-数据源","content":"MySQL 是常见的数据源类型。其他数据库的字段名称会略有差异，但配置思路一致：先填写连接信息，再测试连接，最后保存并检查表字段。"},"6707":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-87","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-mysql-数据源","content":"表单中最关键的是“Crest 服务器是否能访问这个地址”。很多连接失败不是账号错误，而是将仅本地可访问的地址配置到服务器环境。填写完成后先测试连接，再保存；测试失败时不建议保存给后续人员排查。"},"6708":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-88","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-mysql-数据源","content":"这张表单可以按“名称、网络、身份、库表范围”四步填写："},"6709":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-89","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-mysql-数据源","content":"名称先写清楚用途，例如“项目交付库-生产只读”，便于后续用户判断是否为正确来源。"},"6710":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-90","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-mysql-数据源","content":"主机和端口写 Crest 服务能访问的地址。部署在服务器上的 Crest 不能访问你电脑上的 `localhost`。"},"6711":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-91","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-mysql-数据源","content":"用户名和密码使用只读账号。后续密码轮换时，要提前通知使用这个数据源的数据集负责人。"},"6712":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-92","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-mysql-数据源","content":"数据库名或 Schema 要和 DBA 给出的范围一致。看不到表时，先排查这里和账号权限。"},"6713":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-93","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#选择类型","content":"在数据源页面点击“新建数据源”，选择 MySQL。正式环境建议先在左侧资源树中切到正确文件夹，再点击新建。"},"6714":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-94","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#填写名称","content":"名称要能让后续使用者直接判断来源和用途，例如“经营数仓-生产只读”“CRM-客户分析只读”。不要使用“mysql1”“测试库”“新数据源”这类名称。"},"6715":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-95","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#填写连接信息","content":"依次填写主机、端口、数据库名、用户名和密码。主机填写 Crest 服务可访问的地址，不一定是本地客户端可访问的地址。"},"6716":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-96","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#设置高级参数","content":"只有数据库管理员明确要求时再填写高级参数，例如 SSL、连接超时、字符集或 JDBC 参数。不确定含义的参数不要随意追加。"},"6717":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-97","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#测试连接","content":"点击“测试连接”。测试失败时不建议直接保存，先按错误提示排查网络、账号、库名和权限。"},"6718":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-98","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#保存并检查","content":"保存后进入数据源详情，确认表列表、字段列表和数据预览都能正常加载。"},"6719":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-99","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#保存并检查","content":"常用字段说明："},"6720":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-100","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#保存并检查","content":"字段"},"6721":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-101","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#保存并检查","content":"填写说明"},"6722":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-102","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#保存并检查","content":"常见错误"},"6723":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-103","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#保存并检查","content":"数据源名称"},"6724":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-104","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#保存并检查","content":"面向业务用户的名称"},"6725":{"id":"/docs/crest/u