"},"6764":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-144","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-excelcsv-数据源","content":"文件名和数据源名称要能表达业务含义。"},"6765":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-145","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-excelcsv-数据源","content":"文件保存后，Crest 会把表头识别为字段。后续如果替换文件，字段名和字段类型要尽量保持一致，否则下游数据集和图表可能需要重新配置。"},"6766":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-146","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"API 数据源用于读取外部接口。它适合无法直接开放数据库、只提供服务接口的系统。配置 API 前，需要拿到接口文档，并确认鉴权、分页和返回结构。"},"6767":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-147","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"API 表单先配置接口级信息，例如请求地址、请求方式、鉴权和公共参数。这里建议使用系统服务账号，不使用个人 Token；接口有过期时间或频率限制时，要在数据源说明里写清楚，方便后续维护。"},"6768":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-148","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"填写 API 表单时，先用接口调试工具确认接口能返回数据，再回到 Crest 配置。Crest 里保存的不是“接口文档”，而是一个能被数据集读取的数据入口。请求方式、Header、Body、分页和超时只要有一项不对，后续数据集就可能空白或只读到第一页。"},"6769":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-149","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"创建 API 数据源后，需要在数据源内添加 API 表。每个 API 表可以理解为一个可被数据集使用的接口结果。"},"6770":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-150","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"添加 API 表时，重点是把接口返回结果整理成“表”。如果接口返回的是嵌套 JSON，要明确取哪一层作为数据行、哪些字段作为列。保存前使用测试请求检查返回结果，不应只凭接口文档配置。"},"6771":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-151","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"例如接口返回："},"6772":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-152","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"这时通常要把 `data.records` 作为数据行，把 `project`、`stage`、`count` 作为字段。不应把整个 `data` 对象作为一个字段，否则图表只能看到一段 JSON 文本，无法按项目或阶段统计。"},"6773":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-153","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"当前版本已包含 API 数据源 JsonPath 解析修复。启用 JsonPath 后，系统会按指定节点解析行数据，而不是继续按完整响应推断结构。例如接口返回数据在 `$data.dataList` 下时，应把该路径配置为数据行位置，再从子节点中选择字段。启用 JsonPath 后，字段选择仍保持可编辑，便于补充字段名称、类型和业务说明。"},"6774":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-154","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"常见 JsonPath 配置示例："},"6775":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-155","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"返回结构"},"6776":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-156","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"行数据路径"},"6777":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-157","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"字段配置"},"6778":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-158","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"`{ \"data\": { \"dataList\": [ ... ] } }`"},"6779":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-159","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"`$data.dataList`"},"6780":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-