":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置大屏导出按钮","content":"展示在大屏上的按钮文字，例如“导出明细”“下载当前筛选结果”"},"7747":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-231","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置大屏导出按钮","content":"目标表格"},"7748":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-232","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置大屏导出按钮","content":"选择当前大屏中的明细表、汇总表或透视表组件"},"7749":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-233","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置大屏导出按钮","content":"导出范围"},"7750":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-234","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置大屏导出按钮","content":"可选择当前筛选结果或全部数据"},"7751":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-235","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置大屏导出按钮","content":"透视表格式"},"7752":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-236","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置大屏导出按钮","content":"透视表可按配置导出带格式 Excel"},"7753":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-237","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置大屏导出按钮","content":"配置步骤："},"7754":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-238","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#先配置表格","content":"先把明细表或汇总表放到画布中，完成数据集、字段、排序、表头说明和权限检查。"},"7755":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-239","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#添加导出按钮","content":"在组件面板中添加导出按钮，将按钮放在表格附近或页面操作区。"},"7756":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-240","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#绑定目标表格","content":"在按钮配置中选择要导出的表格组件。目标表格应是用户当前能看懂、能核对的数据。"},"7757":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-241","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#选择导出范围","content":"需要按页面查询组件、联动和外部参数导出时，选择当前筛选结果。需要导出完整数据时，确认权限和数据量后再选择全部数据。"},"7758":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-242","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#预览并验证","content":"发布前进入预览页，设置筛选条件后点击导出按钮，确认导出中心生成任务，下载后核对字段、表头和数据范围。"},"7759":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-243","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#预览并验证","content":"导出按钮不是简单截图下载。表格视图导出会结合当前筛选、联动、外部参数、Web 参数和钻取上下文生成 Excel。正式大屏中建议把导出按钮放在明细表附近，并用清晰文案说明导出范围。"},"7760":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-244","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#实战做出示例里的关键组件","content":"内置大屏里有几类组件适合复用：累积流图、阶段漏斗、投入产出矩阵、明细表、趋势图和时效排行。下面按“组件效果、示例字段、编辑器配置”说明。示例字段只用于演示配置思路，正式页面应替换为企业自己的需求、项目、人员、质量或经营字段。"},"7761":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-245","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"这张图用于看需求在不同阶段的堆积情况。面积越厚，说明该阶段积压越多；整体上升，说明需求池总量在增长；某个颜色持续变厚，通常代表该阶段成为瓶颈。"},"7762":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-246","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"演示示例配置："},"7763":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-247","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"配置项"},"7764":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-248","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"示例字段（可替换）"},"7765":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-249","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"图表类型"},"7766":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-250","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"累积流图"},"7767":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-251","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"数据集"},"7768":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-252","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"需求阶段每日快照类数据集"},"7769":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-253","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"X 轴"},"7770":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-254","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"日期 `stat_date`"},"7771":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-255","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"Y 轴"},"7772":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-256","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"需求数 `req_count`，汇总方式为求和"},"7773":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-257","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"堆叠/系列"},"7774":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-258","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"需求阶段 `stage_name`"},"7775":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-259","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"创建步骤："},"7776":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-260","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#准备数据集","content":"数据集至少要有日期、阶段、需求数三个字段。日期是一行快照的统计日期，阶段是需求当时所在阶段，需求数是该日期该阶段的数量。"},"7777":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-261","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#添加累积流图","content":"在大屏编辑器点击“图表”，选择累积流图。把组件放到页面主图区，宽度建议占页面一半以上，高度保持足够展示空间。"},"7778":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-262","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#绑定字段","content":"选择数据集后，把“日期”放入 X 轴，把“需求数”放入 Y 轴，把“需求阶段”放入系列或堆叠字段。"},"7779":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-263","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#设置排序","content":"阶段顺序建议按业务流转顺序排列，例如需求池、分析澄清、就绪待开发、开发中、代码评审、测试验证、待发布。"},"7780":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-264","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"打开平滑曲线和面积填充，保留图例。颜色按阶段固定，避免每次刷新后变化。X 轴日期可以按天或周展示，标签过密时减少显示。"},"7781":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-265","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"使用提醒：累积流图依赖“每日阶段快照”。如果只有当前状态，没有历史快照，就无法还原阶段变化，只能做当前阶段分布。"},"7782":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-266","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"可以按以下样例准备数据。字段名不必完全一样，但含义要对应："},"7783":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-267","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"统计日期"},"7784":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-268","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"需求阶段"},"7785":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-269","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"需求数"},"7786":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-270","page_id":"/d