-guide/screen#添加矩阵组件","content":"在图表组件中选择矩阵、散点或投入产出类组件。这个图适合放在页面左上或主图区，因为它承载决策判断。"},"7861":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-345","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置坐标轴","content":"X 轴放投入人天，Y 轴放交付需求数。两个字段都要是数值字段，文本字段不适合作为坐标轴数值。"},"7862":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-346","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置气泡和颜色","content":"气泡大小放需求工时，颜色放效率等级。低效率、中效率、高效率使用固定颜色，方便用户快速判断。"},"7863":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-347","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置辅助线","content":"设置投入基线和产出基线，把画面分为低产低投、高产低投、高产高投、低产高投四个区域。区域文案要直接写业务判断。"},"7864":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-348","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置辅助线","content":"使用提醒：矩阵图最怕口径不清。投入人天、需求数和需求工时的统计周期必须一致，否则象限判断会误导用户。"},"7865":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-349","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置辅助线","content":"矩阵图的数据结构可以按团队、人员或供应商聚合。示例："},"7866":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-350","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置辅助线","content":"团队"},"7867":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-351","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置辅助线","content":"人力投入人天"},"7868":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-352","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置辅助线","content":"交付需求数"},"7869":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-353","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置辅助线","content":"需求工时"},"7870":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-354","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url