uide/screen#设置表格样式","content":"表头使用浅底色，行高不要太小。大屏上表格主要用于定位，不适合展示过密文本。"},"7903":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-387","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#设置表格样式","content":"使用提醒：大屏表格不是 Excel。字段要少、列名要短、排序要明确，建议只展示需要现场处理的记录。"},"7904":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-388","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#吞吐量月度趋势","content":"趋势图用于看交付节奏。示例中用月份做 X 轴，同时展示进入需求数和交付需求数。"},"7905":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-389","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#吞吐量月度趋势","content":"配置方式："},"7906":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-390","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#吞吐量月度趋势","content":"配置项"},"7907":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-391","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#吞吐量月度趋势","content":"示例字段（可替换）"},"7908":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-392","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#吞吐量月度趋势","content":"图表类型"},"7909":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-393","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#吞吐量月度趋势","content":"折线图"},"7910":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-394","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#吞吐量月度趋势","content":"X 轴"},"7911":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-395","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#吞吐量月度趋势","content":"月份 `month_label`"},"7912":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-396","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#吞吐量月度趋势","content":"Y 轴"},"7913":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-39