式。大屏制作中不要频繁手工拖出不同尺寸，建议同一行组件保持相同高度，相邻组件保持一致间距。"},"7933":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-417","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第四步调整样式","content":"样式调整顺序："},"7934":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-418","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第四步调整样式","content":"标题：先统一大屏标题、图表标题和指标标题的字号。"},"7935":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-419","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第四步调整样式","content":"数字：核心指标数字要最大，单位要贴近数字。"},"7936":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-420","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第四步调整样式","content":"颜色：同类指标使用同一颜色，异常和风险使用固定警示色。"},"7937":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-421","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第四步调整样式","content":"背景：每个组件可以有轻微底色，但背景不能影响文字识别。"},"7938":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-422","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第四步调整样式","content":"标签：只显示必要标签，密集图表不宜全开标签。"},"7939":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-423","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第四步调整样式","content":"图例：系列多时保留图例，系列少时可以关闭。"},"7940":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-424","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第四步调整样式","content":"边距：组件之间保持一致间距，避免挤在一起。"},"7941":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-425","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第四步调整样式","content":"复刻示例大屏效果时，可按以下方法："},"7942":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-426","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第四步调整样式","content":"做法"},"7943":{"id":